  "supplied_boundaries": [
    "Reuses the conditional Move callback world, genuine native Move/Repair/base manager, stock Lua/type bindings and declared Board/Tile/raw actor/Pilot premises. Inherited P5 acquisition boundaries still apply.",
    "Actual2287b0 propagates Board+0xc into genuine Move/Repair. Actual269cc0 bounds-checks origin, calls unchanged stock target query and clones independently owned cached/output vectors. Targets G8/F8/E8 are constructed, not supplied.",
    "Actual25a2e0 and7e10 produce a declared empty passive aggregate and string. Direct actual25e700 returns AL0 and consumes its genuinely constructed byvalue owned argument; both native268340 calls also execute. Full6cd0/6cf0 global initializers, atexit/CRT startup/destruction and gameplay aggregate population are excluded. No cached false result or skipped constructor instruction.",
    "Actual268920 writes selected origin/target and enforces cached membership through complete268050. Actual Lua TwoClick/Explosion getters, stock GetSkillEffect, original267710 metadata and Move postprocessing run. Actual effect value0 and owner-1 are constructor outputs; actor UID attribution and manager selection/submission are excluded.",
    "One development corridor/world family: H8 to G8 positive, blockedD8(bridge0,4) and occupiedH8 nonmember negatives, followed by native effect restoration. Four selected setter checks are dependent components, not four independent corpus cases. No wait/noop or full availability admission.",
    "Selected type4/mode0/FULL_DELAY effect is constructed and owned. ActorHP/position/storedactive/bMoved are unchanged. Native227bf0/237730 submitted action,2689f0 stats/context dispatch,1610d0 Board dispatch, route settlement, next decision and full turn remain open.",
    "Original guest registry/cache/actor inputs/Skill/path/events remain retained. Temporary shared counts and byvalue query argument release are graded; full guest lifecycle/temporal ownership is excluded. Host GL cleanup is separate, saved handles cannot resume.",
    "Source/whole-input/runtime/map identities checked before and after acquisition. Frozen observed DLL instructions and complete byte-pinned native owners/windows admitted. Native/DLL30second/2million-instruction percall limits are acquisition budgets, not planner timing.",
    "No Rust simulator semantics or candidate solver changed, no new Rust comparison, fair-input/held-out/search certificate/ledger/S1/whole-gate promotion."
